          "reading": "[baː.bu mak.ta.ba.ti‿l.ʒaː.mi.ʕa.ti maf.tuː.ħun li.ʒa.miː.ʕi‿l.baː.ħi.θiː.na watˤ.tˤul.laːb] (Bā-bu mak-ta-ba-ti al-jā-mi-ʿa-ti maf-tū-ḥun li-ja-mī-ʿi al-bā-ḥi-thī-na wa-aṭ-ṭul-lāb.)",
